  lines:
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: Here's one important thing to remember.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: 9804a0ccb68c4404f9d2f5dce9c70874, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: The shotgun gives you a stronger push when you fire at a nearby surface
      than when you fire into empty space.
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 2736272047063480907, guid: a6dce48185b1cf24fb9f542767adc9c2, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Blue Guy
    text: Use that extra force to reach the next platform!
    speakerPosePrefab: {fileID: 7654791619888061114, guid: 1336c22a2ea74af42961e46ed56d15ae, type: 3}
